launch.bg_howto:
follow it: claude agents  ·  claude attach <id>  ·  claude logs <id>
stop it:   claude stop <id>
prompt it from another session: ListAgents -> SendMessage {{"to": "{name}"}}

talk.typed_text:
claude-master talk: the input box of “{name}” holds typed text:
    {text}
  Sending the prompt would erase it (the box is cleared with Escape). Send or clear it yourself, or rerun with --force.

init.cron_line:
crontab line (cadence registry.cron_minutes = {min} min):
  {line}
(--yes installs it; 0 minutes = no cron)
